35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The inland clubs slept eight to a room. Whole-building lets charge for cancellations. We cannot absorb that risk. I need to know the true cost before committing.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The canteen is closed, so we must find staffed kitchens. Also, the public booking lottery is a nine-page nightmare. We need a private venue to avoid that administrative burden.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The sheets show a fifth never came, and the seniors say mixing only happens when we sleep together. We must choose a destination that forces that connection.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,Eight to a room sounds exhausting. I need to know if the public beds offer more privacy. I hope the quiet helps everyone rest better.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The receipts show transport is thirty-eight percent of costs. Worse, whole-building lets charge for cancellations. We need flexible terms to protect the account.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the non-refundable deposit is a trap. If one person cancels, the rest pay. We need flexible terms to protect the account from further deficit.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, I agree. The lottery is a nine-page nightmare. We need a private venue with staffed kitchens to eliminate the cooking burden that destroyed last year’s committee.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Toshio, I hear you on the burden. But if we don't sleep together, the year-groups stay isolated. We need a place that makes connection easy, not just convenient.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I understand the value of connection. But if we are exhausted, we cannot connect. I need to ensure the sleeping arrangements allow for genuine rest first.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, the nine-page lottery is an administrative burden, but the non-refundable deposit is a financial liability. We must prioritize flexible cancellation terms to prevent the account from absorbing individual losses.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minako, connection is vital, but it cannot bankrupt us. If the venue charges for absentees, the account absorbs the loss. We need flexible terms to ensure the fee covers the actual cost.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
